    <string name="page_part_waste_tank">Waste water tank</string>
    <string name="page_condition_running">Running</string>
    <string name="page_condition_stopped">Stopped</string>
    <string name="page_explain_water">The water the fountain holds. Top it up when the fountain says it is low.</string>
    <string name="page_explain_filter">The filter cartridge, by what is left of it. Replace it when it runs out, then reset its counter.</string>
    <string name="page_explain_pump">The pump that keeps the water moving. In smart or intermittent mode it rests between runs, so stopped is not a fault.</string>
    <string name="page_explain_battery">The battery of this cordless fountain. Charge it when it runs low.</string>
    <string name="page_explain_tray">The tray the pets drink from. Empty and clean it when it is full, then put it back.</string>
    <string name="page_explain_clean_tank">The tank of clean water that refills the tray. Fill it and put it back.</string>
    <string name="page_explain_waste_tank">The tank the used water drains into. Empty it and put it back.</string>

